          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_lg"
            ],
            "aside": {
              "role": "line_img_annotation",
              "text": "Car Owner-user Consumption Items ↑"
            },
            "text": {
              "h5": "Three High-frequency Consumption",
              "paragraphs": [
                {
                  "body": "Whether it is a traditional fuel car or new energy electric car, in the after-market owners regularly or irregularly consume the following: car insurance, interior accessories, exterior parts, maintenance, washing, repair, refueling and charging, modification, etc. Some consumption is the owner's active demand, some are passive. The frequency of consumption in the unit year also varies. The main focus is on three consumptions:",
                  "muted": false
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": false,
                  "items": [
                    "1. Decoration",
                    "2. Clean",
                    "3. Maintenance"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line_image",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_md"
            ],
            "kind": "image",
            "src": "https://fwzntx71hl6v6inl.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/auto/using_routine.png",
            "layout": "content"
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_lg"
            ],
            "aside": {
              "role": "line_img_annotation",
              "text": "Car Owner-user Consumption Path ↑"
            },
            "text": {
              "h5": "From Needs Generating to Item and Service Consumption",
              "paragraphs": [
                {
                  "body": "The path of consumption, the type of goods and services provider, and the pros and cons of the existing paths are completely different for car owners under the three needs. In short, the demand for interior and exterior decoration is initiated by the owners, mainly purchased online and installed offline. The demand for cleaning is initiated by the owners, either by going to a store or by their own. The demand for maintenance is initiated by the vehicle, by going to an official service center, a third-party vendor, or maintaining and repairing by the owners.",
                  "muted": false
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": true,
                  "items": [
                    "Decoration: Self-initiated demand → item → service",
                    "Clean: Self-initiated demand → item + service",
                    "Maintenance: Vehicle-initiated demand → service → item"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line_image",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_min"
            ],
            "kind": "image",
            "src": "https://fwzntx71hl6v6inl.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/auto/strategy.png",
            "layout": "content"
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_md"
            ],
            "aside": {
              "role": "line_img_annotation",
              "text": "Product Feature Flow & Design Keys ↑"
            },
            "text": {
              "h5": "One Product for Three Consumption Scenes",
              "paragraphs": [
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": false,
                  "items": [
                    "Feature 1",
                    "Vehicle dynamic status is automatically linked to corresponding consumption contents in order to guide users' next purchasing or service-seeking actions. The main information structure of this product is divided into owning-vehicle dashboard as coordinate and consumption canvas covering decoration, clean and maintenance."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": false,
                  "items": [
                    "Feature 2",
                    "The order of content and tabs is arranged by demand type, frequency and consumption path. The three main consumption tabs are decoration, clean, and maintenance in descending order of frequency."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "body": "For example, Under decoration, goods information is first. Under clean, car wash goods information is first, followed by service store information, and under maintenance, service store information is first, followed by goods information.",
                  "muted": true
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": false,
                  "items": [
                    "Feature 3",
                    "Dynamic adjustment of information layout based on algorithms, car owners' consumption habits."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": false,
                  "items": [
                    "Feature 4",
                    "By means of multimedia contents guide such as short videos, peer group recommendations to meet users-initiated demands like decoration and clean. By means of vehicle data synchronization, specific content corresponding to specific brand vehicle to meet vehicle-initiated demands like maintenance."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line_image",
            "spacing": [],
            "kind": "image",
            "src": "https://fwzntx71hl6v6inl.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/auto/auto_ai.png",
            "layout": "content"
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_md"
            ],
            "aside": {
              "role": "line_img_annotation",
              "text": "Product Information Architecture ↑"
            },
            "text": {
              "h5": "Vehicle-oriented Navigation",
              "paragraphs": [
                {
                  "body": "The first-level bottom navigation bar is divided into discover, category, and shopping cart. The global top bar contains search and profile. In the main discover page, vehicle-driven navigation is used to display the vehicle's dashboard, call-to-action & service procedure assistance, and goods and service recommendations in three cases: decoration, clean, and maintenance, without page jumping.",
                  "muted": false
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line_image",
            "spacing": [],
            "kind": "video",
            "src": "https://fwzntx71hl6v6inl.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/fs/auto/demo_short.mp4",
            "layout": "content"
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_lg"
            ],
            "aside": {
              "role": "line_img_annotation",
              "text": "HVP Interface & System Map ↑"
            },
            "text": {
              "h5": "Vehicle to Service to Driver",
              "paragraphs": [
                {
                  "body": "The vehicle will synchronize the information to the vehicle system interface and the App terminal, the users choose the service or goods consumption according to the vehicle status and the corresponding assistant suggestion. Whether by themselves or service personnel driving vehicles to the service center, vehicle maintenance, washing and care, accessories installation and other service status information will be synchronized to the owner's terminal and the vehicle system.",
                  "muted": false
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line_image",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_md"
            ],
            "kind": "image",
            "src": "https://fwzntx71hl6v6inl.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/auto/interface.png",
            "layout": "content"
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_lg"
            ],
            "aside": {
              "role": "line_img_annotation",
              "text": "Vehicle-oriented UI Cards Kit ↑"
            },
            "text": {
              "h5": "Clear, Unified and Content-Highlighted UI",
              "paragraphs": [
                {
                  "body": "The UI module is divided into vehicle models, dashboards, assistants, items recommendations, service recommendations, etc. Through the visual design of information such as grid, font size, color and other elements, UI keeps unity and clear affordance.",
                  "muted": false
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": true,
                  "items": [
                    "Vehicle model: 3D visualization of vehicle status information.",
                    "Dashboards: The respective record data of decoration, clean and maintenance.",
                    "Assistant: Synchronization of vehicle status, action suggestion, service status.",
                    "Items: Repurchase, peer group recommendations.",
                    "Service: Provider Infomation."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line_image",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_lg"
            ],
            "kind": "image",
            "src": "https://fwzntx71hl6v6inl.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/auto/service_status.png",
            "layout": "content"
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_md"
            ],
            "aside": {
              "role": "line_img_annotation",
              "text": "Service Procedure Assistant Card ↑"
            },
            "text": {
              "h5": "Full State Service Notification",
              "paragraphs": [
                {
                  "body": "Taking maintenance as an example, the assistant is divided into 3 stages:",
                  "muted": false
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": false,
                  "items": [
                    "State 1",
                    "Car condition information synchronization, demand initiation, action guidance (contacting maintenance personnel, store inquiries and appointments)."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": false,
                  "items": [
                    "State 2",
                    "Service information synchronization, material list synchronization and remote ordering."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": false,
                  "items": [
                    "State 3",
                    "Service completion notification, action guidance."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "zh": [
      {
        "bg": "detail_bg_dark",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "detail_cover",
            "kind": "image",
            "src": "https://fwzntx71hl6v6inl.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/auto/auto_cover.png",
            "alt": ""
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line_image",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_md"
            ],
            "kind": "image",
            "src": "https://fwzntx71hl6v6inl.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/auto/market.png",
            "layout": "content"
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_lg"
            ],
            "aside": {
              "role": "line_img_annotation",
              "text": "车主用户消费项目 ↑"
            },
            "text": {
              "h5": "三项高频消费",
              "paragraphs": [
                {
                  "body": "无论传统燃油车还是新能源电动车，车主在后市场都会定期或不定期产生以下消费：车险、内饰配件、外饰部件、保养、洗车、维修、加油与充电、改装等。部分消费由车主主动发起，部分为被动需求；年度消费频次也各不相同。本项目主要聚焦三项消费：",
                  "muted": false
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": false,
                  "items": [
                    "1. 装饰",
                    "2. 清洁",
                    "3. 保养"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line_image",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_md"
            ],
            "kind": "image",
            "src": "https://fwzntx71hl6v6inl.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/auto/using_routine.png",
            "layout": "content"
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_lg"
            ],
            "aside": {
              "role": "line_img_annotation",
              "text": "车主用户消费路径 ↑"
            },
            "text": {
              "h5": "从需求产生到商品与服务消费",
              "paragraphs": [
                {
                  "body": "在三项需求下，车主的消费路径、商品与服务提供方类型，以及既有路径的优劣完全不同。简言之：内外饰需求由车主发起，以线上购买、线下安装为主；清洁需求由车主发起，可到店或自行完成；保养需求由车辆发起，可前往官方服务中心、第三方门店，或由车主自行维保。",
                  "muted": false
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": true,
                  "items": [
                    "装饰：主动需求 → 商品 → 服务",
                    "清洁：主动需求 → 商品 + 服务",
                    "保养：车辆发起需求 → 服务 → 商品"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line_image",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_min"
            ],
            "kind": "image",
            "src": "https://fwzntx71hl6v6inl.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/auto/strategy.png",
            "layout": "content"
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_md"
            ],
            "aside": {
              "role": "line_img_annotation",
              "text": "产品功能流程与设计要点 ↑"
            },
            "text": {
              "h5": "一款产品覆盖三类消费场景",
              "paragraphs": [
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": false,
                  "items": [
                    "特性一",
                    "车辆动态状态自动关联对应消费内容，以引导用户下一步的购买或服务寻求行为。本产品的主要信息结构以所拥有车辆的仪表盘为坐标，并以覆盖装饰、清洁与保养的消费画布为载体。"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": false,
                  "items": [
                    "特性二",
                    "内容与标签页的顺序按需求类型、频次与消费路径排列。三大消费标签按频次由高到低依次为：装饰、清洁、保养。"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "body": "例如：在装饰场景下，商品信息优先；在清洁场景下，洗车商品信息优先，其次为服务门店信息；在保养场景下，服务门店信息优先，其次为商品信息。",
                  "muted": true
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": false,
                  "items": [
                    "特性三",
                    "基于算法与车主消费习惯，动态调整信息布局。"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": false,
                  "items": [
                    "特性四",
                    "借助短视频、同伴推荐等多媒体内容引导，满足装饰与清洁等用户主动需求；借助车辆数据同步，按具体品牌车型推送对应内容，满足保养等车辆发起需求。"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line_image",
            "spacing": [],
            "kind": "image",
            "src": "https://fwzntx71hl6v6inl.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/auto/auto_ai.png",
            "layout": "content"
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_md"
            ],
            "aside": {
              "role": "line_img_annotation",
              "text": "产品信息架构 ↑"
            },
            "text": {
              "h5": "以车辆为导向的导航",
              "paragraphs": [
                {
                  "body": "一级底部导航栏分为发现、分类与购物车；全局顶栏包含搜索与个人中心。在主要的发现页中，采用车辆驱动导航，在装饰、清洁与保养三种情况下展示车辆仪表盘、行动号召与服务流程辅助，以及商品与服务推荐，无需页面跳转。",
                  "muted": false
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line_image",
            "spacing": [],
            "kind": "video",
            "src": "https://fwzntx71hl6v6inl.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/fs/auto/demo_short.mp4",
            "layout": "content"
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_lg"
            ],
            "aside": {
              "role": "line_img_annotation",
              "text": "HVP 界面与系统地图 ↑"
            },
            "text": {
              "h5": "从车辆到服务再到驾驶者",
              "paragraphs": [
                {
                  "body": "车辆将信息同步至车机系统界面与 App 终端，用户根据车辆状态及相应助手建议选择服务或商品消费。无论由本人或服务人员驾车前往服务中心，车辆保养、洗护、配件安装等服务状态信息均将同步至车主终端与车机系统。",
                  "muted": false
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line_image",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_md"
            ],
            "kind": "image",
            "src": "https://fwzntx71hl6v6inl.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/auto/interface.png",
            "layout": "content"
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_lg"
            ],
            "aside": {
              "role": "line_img_annotation",
              "text": "以车辆为导向的 UI 卡片套件 ↑"
            },
            "text": {
              "h5": "清晰、统一且内容突出的界面",
              "paragraphs": [
                {
                  "body": "UI 模块划分为车辆模型、仪表盘、助手、商品推荐、服务推荐等。通过网格、字号、色彩等视觉信息设计，界面保持统一并具备清晰的可供性。",
                  "muted": false
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": true,
                  "items": [
                    "车辆模型：车辆状态信息的三维可视化。",
                    "仪表盘：装饰、清洁与保养各自的记录数据。",
                    "助手：车辆状态同步、行动建议、服务状态。",
                    "商品：复购、同伴推荐。",
                    "服务：服务商信息。"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line_image",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_lg"
            ],
            "kind": "image",
            "src": "https://fwzntx71hl6v6inl.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/auto/service_status.png",
            "layout": "content"
          },
          {
            "type": "detail_line",
            "spacing": [
              "spacing_bottom_md"
            ],
            "aside": {
              "role": "line_img_annotation",
              "text": "服务流程助手卡片 ↑"
            },
            "text": {
              "h5": "全状态服务通知",
              "paragraphs": [
                {
                  "body": "以保养为例，助手分为三个阶段：",
                  "muted": false
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": false,
                  "items": [
                    "状态一",
                    "车况信息同步、需求发起、行动引导（联系维保人员、门店查询与预约）。"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": false,
                  "items": [
                    "状态二",
                    "服务信息同步、物料清单同步与远程下单。"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": true,
                  "bare": true,
                  "muted": false,
                  "items": [
                    "状态三",
                    "服务完成通知、行动引导。"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "ja": [
      {
        "bg": "detail_bg_dark",
        "blocks": [
